@startuml
title Architecture Diagram

actor "User Interface\n(Web/Mobile App/CLI)" as UI

package "Java Backend API\n(JAX-RS)" as API {

  rectangle "Teacher Agent" as TeacherAgent
  rectangle "Evaluator Agent" as EvaluatorAgent
  rectangle "Retriever Agent" as RetrieverAgent

  rectangle "DatabaseClient" as DBC
  rectangle "GeminiApiClient" as GeminiClient

}

database "Database\n(Assignments, Feedback, History)" as DB

rectangle "Gemini API" as GeminiAPI
rectangle "GitHub API" as GitHubAPI


' --- Layout and Relationships ---

UI -down-> API : Interacts via

API --> TeacherAgent : Delegates tasks
API --> EvaluatorAgent : Delegates tasks
API --> RetrieverAgent : Delegates tasks


' Interactions via Gemini Client
TeacherAgent --> GeminiClient : Uses
EvaluatorAgent --> GeminiClient : Uses
RetrieverAgent --> GeminiClient : Uses

GeminiClient --> GeminiAPI : Calls

' Interactions with Database
TeacherAgent --> DBC : Accesses state
EvaluatorAgent --> DBC : Accesses state
RetrieverAgent --> DBC : Accesses state
DBC --> DB : Reads/Writes

' Interactions with GitHub (positioned closer to Retriever Agent)
RetrieverAgent --> GitHubAPI : Uses dedicated client


' Optional: Add notes or specific interactions
' TeacherAgent --> DB : Persists Assignments
' EvaluatorAgent --> DB : Persists Feedback
' RetrieverAgent --> DB : Persists Feedback
' RetrieverAgent --> DB : Persists History


@enduml